1
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,240
听我说 各位
Listen up, everybody.

2
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:05,980
有一件小怪事
Something strange is afoot.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,480
别对自己这么严苛 阿憨
Don't be hard on yourself, Han.

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:08,600
你比小怪稍微高一点啦
You're taller than a foot.

5
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:11,260
怎么了
What's wrong?

6
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,120
又有人把你当弥勒佛 摸你肚子求平安吗
Somebody rub your belly for luck again?

7
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:16,780
不是 是我觉得我失忆了
No, I think I might be losing my memory.

8
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,940
根据我的付费网络台观看记录
According to Netflix, last night I watched

9
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:22,400
我看了1.5部《飓风营救》和《潜伏》123
half the "Taken"s and all the "Insidious"es-es.

10
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:23,140
3部全看了
All of them!

11
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,720
别紧张 你可能梦游时看了
Relax. You probably just sleep-watched them.

12
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,780
你梦游时可能还顺便
And you probably also sleep-ordered

13
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,440
在亚马逊网购了28盒卫生棉条
28 boxes of tampons on Amazon.

14
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:35,160
麦克斯 你黑进我的账号啊
Max, you hacked into my accounts?

15
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,120
这可是犯法的呀
That's illegal!

16
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:39,260
而且还超出了我对你智商的判断
And beyond what I thought you were intellectually capable of!

17
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:43,722
猜你那种密码哪能算黑啊
Not much of a hack when the password is

18
00:00:43,722 --> 00:00:45,945
"憨情时速"
"Hanstoppable."

19
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,820
姑娘们 你们这是违背他的信任啊
That's a breach of trust, girls.

20
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,420
你们帮我订购那鞋子了吗
Did you order me those shoes?

21
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,560
靠 早知道我密码用"憨色池塘"了
Dammit! I should have gone with "Han Golden Pond."

22
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:12,380
太阳从西边出来了
Oh, this is weird.

23
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:13,660
我收到一条伯纳德的语音留言
There's a message from Bernard,

24
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:14,780
他是我奶奶的管家
my grandmother's butler.

25
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:16,040
他怎么会找我
Why would he be calling me?

26
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:17,880
可能手机在裤"管"里压到了
Maybe he butler-dialed you.

27
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:21,060
卡洛琳 你好吗
Caroline, hello.

28
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:23,440
我是替你奶奶打这通电话
I'm calling on behalf of your grandmother.

29
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:27,820
她理由都不给一个就抛下我四年
Wait, she abandons me after four years with no explanation

30
00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:29,420
她现在居然好意思来找我
and now she reaches out?

31
00:01:29,420 --> 00:01:29,960
我都沦落到这样了
Now?

32
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:32,120
说什么理由都没用
There is no excuse for that.

33
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,760
她这几年陷入昏迷了
She's been in a coma.

34
00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:37,300
好吧 看来有一个理由有用
Okay, there's one excuse for that.

35
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,020
她现在醒了 想见你
But she's awake now and wants to see you.

36
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:42,535
麦克斯 她想见我
Max, she wants to see me.

37
00:01:42,535 --> 00:01:44,360
我去打电话联系他
I'm going to go call him.

38
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:46,920
她不是避而不见 而是半个身子进鬼门关了
She didn't shun me, she was just practically dead!

39
00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:51,240
麦克斯 能问问你的意见吗
Max, can I ask your opinion about something?

40
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:53,520
如果我跟苏菲想要宝宝
If Sophie and I want to get pregnant,

41
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,940
她就需要服药
she needs to be on drugs.

42
00:01:55,260 --> 00:01:57,200
嗑嗨了才愿意跟你搞吗 我明白
Oh, to have sex with you? I get that.

43
00:01:58,940 --> 00:02:00,490
不是 是助孕药
No, fertility drugs.

44
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,800
我上一次在性事上面花这么多钱
I haven't paid this much for sex

45
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,860
是08年杂交盛宴游轮票
since Orgy Cruise '08.

46
00:02:06,380 --> 00:02:08,740
所以我想求阿憨给我加薪
So I'm going to ask Han for a raise.

47
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:09,940
你觉得有戏吗
What do you think?

48
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,420
我觉得会是一场精彩的好剧
I think that'll be fun to watch.

49
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,580
我想出一个新密码了
Well, I've come up with a new password

50
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:17,100
你们绝对猜不到
that none of you will ever guess.

51
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:19,326
《憨娜·蒙塔娜》
Han-ah Montana?

52
00:02:21,572 --> 00:02:23,143
我靠
Dammit!

53
00:02:23,629 --> 00:02:25,199
阿憨今天很帅哦
Lookin' good, Han.

54
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:26,880
你去知名成人西服店买衣服了吗
Have you been shopping at Men's Wearhouse?

55
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:29,720
就爱你这范儿[广告语]
'Cause I like the way you look.

56
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:34,460
你明知道我只去另一家折扣服饰店
You know I exclusively shop at T.J. Maxx.

57
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:37,460
每年就靠它们让我挥别春季 喜迎夏季
They've been helping me spring into summer for years.

58
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:40,540
大家安安
Hey, everybody!

59
00:02:44,113 --> 00:02:46,360
奥列格 咋样了
Oleg, what happened?

60
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:48,740
你让泡菜妹给你加薪了吗
Did you ask that little Korean girl for a raise?

61
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:55,300
麦克斯 我奶奶让我明天去见她
Max, my grandmother wants me to come and see her tomorrow!

62
00:02:55,540 --> 00:02:56,680
好兴奋啊
This is so exciting.

63
00:02:56,820 --> 00:02:59,760
我家族还有其他没被关进联邦监狱的活人
Someone in my family is alive and not in federal prison.

64
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:02,200
的确让人兴奋
That is exciting.

65
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:03,780
你觉得我们能捞到多少银子
How much money do you think we're getting?

66
00:03:03,860 --> 00:03:04,540
她有钱对吧
She's rich, right?

67
00:03:05,780 --> 00:03:08,160
真不敢相信这些年她居然是昏迷了
I can't believe all this time she was in a coma.

68
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:10,280
我也不敢相信你认识昏迷的人
I can't believe you knew someone in a coma

69
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:12,160
却没给我机会在他们脸上画胡子
and I didn't get to draw a mustache on them.

70
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:18,720
你好啊 卡洛琳
Hello, Caroline.

71
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:21,820
你奶奶的家很豪华嘛
Your grandmother's place is fancy.

72
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,220
我就直说出来吧
I'm just gonna say it.

73
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:25,240
我觉得没人在那台电梯里撒过尿呢
I don't think anybody has ever peed in there.

74
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:27,640
伯纳德
Bernard!

75
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:29,480
岁月没在你脸上留下一点痕迹啊
You haven't aged at all.

76
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,240
谢谢
Thank you.

77
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:32,720
毕竟她睡了四年 没空守她的面霜
She hasn't been awake to guard her creams.

78
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,580
这里让我想起好多童年回忆
Oh, this brings back so many childhood memories.

79
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:41,920
以前我们的4.2米高圣诞树就摆这里
Right here is where we had our 14-foot Christmas tree.

80
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:45,480
而奶奶就是在这里给我一年一度的抱抱
And then right here is where she'd give me her yearly hug.

81
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:49,980
卡洛琳 你从丑闻的谷底反弹回来了吗
Well, Caroline, have you bounced back from the scandal?

82
00:03:50,340 --> 00:03:52,780
如果在餐厅打工 睡折叠床
If you count working at a diner, sleeping in a wall,

83
00:03:52,780 --> 00:03:54,320
上在线药房买衣服算反弹
and clothes shopping at CVS,

84
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,440
那她弹力超足
then she's real bouncy.

85
00:03:57,260 --> 00:03:59,360
这位是你的同性伴侣吗
And is this your same-sex partner?

86
00:04:00,700 --> 00:04:02,560
如果遗产有我一份 那我就是
I will be if that gets me in the will.

87
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:06,178
伯纳德 她是麦克斯 我的室友
Bernard, this is Max. She's my roommate.

88
00:04:06,178 --> 00:04:10,567
我们那个年代就这么"称呼"
Yes, that's what we called them back in the day.

89
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,360
她发现呼唤铃了
Oh, she's found the bell.

90
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:16,520
我"走大运"啊
Lucky me.

91
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:18,840
但刚才只是摇一下
But that was just a single dingle.

92
00:04:19,060 --> 00:04:20,240
单摇是警告
A warning dingle.

93
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:25,140
双摇就喊救命啦
Double dingle. Mayday.

94
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,140
阿斯特丽德奶奶 是我 卡洛琳
Grammy Astrid, it's Caroline!

95
00:04:31,293 --> 00:04:32,940
亲爱的 我知道
I know, darling.

96
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:34,980
我只是老 又不是瞎
I'm old, not blind.

97
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:38,460
人家好想好想你
I've missed you so much.

98
00:04:40,100 --> 00:04:42,720
小心点 别把她弄太兴奋
Careful. Don't get her overexcited.

99
00:04:43,980 --> 00:04:46,880
开窗 貌似闻到有个屁精在房里
Crack a window. Smells like Ass-trid in here.

100
00:04:48,100 --> 00:04:50,900
我的确是该把体力留给
I suppose I should conserve my energy

101
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:52,840
你要为我办的午宴上
for the luncheon you're going to throw me.

102
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:54,560
什么午宴
What luncheon now?

103
00:04:54,700 --> 00:04:55,681
你将要为她办的那个
The one you're going to throw

104
00:04:55,681 --> 00:04:57,160
重回社交圈午宴啊
to re-introduce her to society,

105
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,500
有点类似出场[柜]派对
a sort of coming out party.

106
00:04:59,260 --> 00:05:00,100
这不应该是你的专业领域吗
Isn't that more your turf?

107
00:05:02,740 --> 00:05:04,540
奶奶 我也很乐意为你办午宴
Grammy, I'd be happy to throw you a luncheon

108
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:05,940
可是我付...
but I can't afford--

109
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:10,500
抱歉 卡洛琳 别在意那些事
Sorry. Caroline, never mind all that.

110
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:12,260
应该先介绍朋友
Introductions are in order.

111
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:15,760
奶奶 这位是我的朋友 麦克斯
Oh, Grammy. This is my friend, Max.

112
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:18,520
这个嘛... 欢迎醒来
Hey, uh, I guess, welcome back.

113
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:22,160
卡洛琳 你真是一点都没变
You haven't changed a bit, Caroline.

114
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:25,060
总是跟佣人们交朋友
Always making friends with the help.

115
00:05:27,580 --> 00:05:29,040
是叫玛丽亚是吧
Maria, was it?

116
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:31,620
用高脚杯给我装杯水来 麻烦啦[西语]
I'll take a tall glass of agua, por favor.

117
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,400
希望我背后有这位玛丽亚
Hoping there's a Maria behind me.

118
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,960
卡洛琳 你好吗
Caroline, how have you been?

119
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:42,700
你成为华尔街之王了吗
Are you running Wall Street yet?

120
00:05:43,300 --> 00:05:45,860
没 但我给自己剪了头发
No, but I did cut my hair,

121
00:05:45,860 --> 00:05:47,120
这可是件又惊又喜的事
which was scary but rewarding.

122
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:52,300
奶奶 今非昔比 自从我失...
Grammy, a lot has changed since I lost all my--

123
00:05:54,435 --> 00:05:57,253
说真的 兄弟 去检查下肺好吗
Seriously, dude, get an x-ray.

124
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,280
现在立刻跟我出来
Outside. Now.

125
00:06:01,780 --> 00:06:04,640
还在等那杯水呢 玛丽亚
And still waiting on that agua, Maria.

126
00:06:06,221 --> 00:06:08,007
好啦好啦好啦[西语]
Ay, yi yi.

127
00:06:13,820 --> 00:06:16,020
好了 伯纳德 你是在鬼哭狼嚎啥
Okay, Bernard, what's with the "Gahs"?

128
00:06:17,580 --> 00:06:19,500
我说话时你打断我的频繁度
You interrupted what I was saying so often,

129
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:20,640
差点让我以为我们是夫妻
it's like we're a married couple.

130
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:23,080
我是在阻止你
I was trying to stop you

131
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,820
提起你爸爸陷入的那个丑闻
from mentioning your father's scandal.

132
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,620
原来啊 我还以为那是英国人独特放屁方法
Oh, I thought that's just how British people fart.

133
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:31,740
你奶奶完全不知道那档事
Your grandmother has no memory of what happened.

134
00:06:31,980 --> 00:06:33,740
而当我试着告诉她那坏消息时
When I attempted to tell her the bad news,

135
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,480
她就中风陷入昏迷了
she had a stroke and slipped into a coma.

136
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:37,600
我当时就说"你儿子好像有点麻烦"
I said, "Your son might be in some trouble,"

137
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,920
才这样 她就倒下了
and that was it; she was out.

138
00:06:40,300 --> 00:06:43,160
她不知道我身无分文了吗
She doesn't know I lost all my money?

139
00:06:43,340 --> 00:06:44,860
我知道 很惨
I know. It's terrible.

140
00:06:44,980 --> 00:06:47,460
但更惨的是你得告诉她 她也身无分文了
And what's worse is you have to tell her she's lost all hers.

141
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:49,980
她破产了吗
She's broke?

142
00:06:50,300 --> 00:06:51,720
那老娘干嘛还给她端水啊
Then why did I get her that water?

143
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:59,280
姑娘们 屏息以待
Hey, girls. Buckle up.

144
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:02,040
奥列格要再去求阿憨加薪了
Oleg's gonna ask Han for a raise again.

145
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:04,460
小心 热腾腾天菜驾到
Hot stuff, coming through.

146
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:07,340
快看 是翻版男厨牌 男畜牌大厨
Oh look, it's Chef Boy-Are-You-Gross.

147
00:07:10,820 --> 00:07:12,540
帽子不错吧
Nice hat, right?

148
00:07:12,820 --> 00:07:14,380
我们在床上玩角色扮演时他也会戴
He wears it in the bedroom when we role-play.

149
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,560
我是爱挑剔的客人
I'm the fussy customer,

150
00:07:17,060 --> 00:07:19,320
而他会来我的"小饼干"上涂"奶油"
and he slathers butter on my biscuit.

151
00:07:21,020 --> 00:07:22,840
全套服装不止这样
This isn't the whole costume.

152
00:07:23,100 --> 00:07:26,760
我还会给我的"大雕"也戴一顶小帽子
I also wear a drumstick paper frill around my penis.

153
00:07:27,979 --> 00:07:31,147
用"鸡"愉快
Boner appetit.

154
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,340
阿憨来了
Oh, here comes Han.

155
00:07:33,460 --> 00:07:34,360
好戏登场啦
It's showtime, baby.

156
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,580
我想到了一个新密码
Well, I have a new password

157
00:07:36,580 --> 00:07:38,239
绝对没人可以猜到
that no one will ever get.

158
00:07:38,239 --> 00:07:40,380
"冲出憨普顿"吗
"Straight Outta Compt-Han"?

159
00:07:43,580 --> 00:07:44,180
我靠
Dammit!

160
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:50,220
这菜好好吃啊
This food is so good.

161
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:53,700
不得不称赞雇用了这位厨师的那个天才
My compliments to the man who hired the chef.

162
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:58,900
奥列格 你不可能因为苏菲演得她吃了
Oleg, you're not getting a raise just because Sophie can act

163
00:07:58,900 --> 00:08:00,980
你的食物很满意就获得加薪
like your food is yummy in her tummy.

164
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:05,400
如果我换个口音 你会改变主意吗
Would you change your mind if I did it in a different accent?

165
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:08,860
我以前在波兰当过女演员 我能学好多口音呢
I used to act in Poland. I can do a whole bunch.

166
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,960
我的老天
My word.

167
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:17,200
这意式饺子人间美味啊
I just love this tasty tortellini.

168
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,480
多谢你带给我一夜恶梦
Thank you for tonight's nightmare.

169
00:08:41,280 --> 00:08:42,580
一个桌吗
Uh, table for one?

170
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:44,400
不用了 谢谢
Not for this one, thank you.

171
00:08:45,780 --> 00:08:47,500
伯纳德 你好啊 你来这里干什么
Bernard, hi. What are you doing here?

172
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:49,660
我也想问你这个问题
I could ask the same of you and follow up

173
00:08:49,660 --> 00:08:52,480
外加一连串关于这身制服的问题
with a series of questions about that hideous uniform.

174
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:55,220
看起来就像黄芥末跟番茄酱打了一架
Looks like mustard and ketchup had a fight

175
00:08:55,220 --> 00:08:56,120
最后全都输了
and everyone lost.

176
00:08:58,680 --> 00:09:01,680
干啥呢 老"伯" 你跟这里格格不入
What up, B-nard? You look even paler here.

177
00:09:02,980 --> 00:09:04,800
而你跟这里简直"臭味相投"
And you look perfect here.

178
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,260
这是让你明天午宴穿的衣服
Now, something to wear for tomorrow's luncheon.

179
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,360
你奶奶旧的香奈儿套装
One of your grandmother's Chanel suits.

180
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,260
而这里是宾客表
Here's her guest list.

181
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:15,140
貌似只有一个人选了"会来"
I'm afraid only one guest RSVP'd "Yes."

182
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:17,920
其他人都选了"已死"
All the rest of her friends RSVP'd "Dead."

183
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:22,280
伯纳德 我真的很希望能满足奶奶的愿望
Bernard, I really do wish I could give my Grammy what she wants,

184
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:24,800
但我真的没有钱帮她办真的豪华午宴
but I don't have the money for a real fancy luncheon.

185
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:26,720
我连真的牛奶都喝不起
Or even real milk, for that matter.

186
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:29,020
我们都喝"类牛奶饮料"
We drink "milk drink."

187
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:34,080
我觉得她承受不起更多失望了
I don't think she can take much more disappointment.

188
00:09:34,420 --> 00:09:35,900
今早我不得不告诉她 她最爱的运动员
This morning I had to tell her all about

189
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:38,000
布鲁斯·詹那的事[变性]
her favorite athlete, Bruce Jenner.

190
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,780
这也太凄惨了
This is so sad.

191
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:47,220
奶奶的一切都没了
Grammy's whole world is gone

192
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:48,460
而她还浑然不知
and she has no idea.

193
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:51,400
麦克斯 我起码得满足她这么一个心愿
Max, I have to give her the one thing that she wants.

194
00:09:51,540 --> 00:09:53,580
重回白人之外皆无人权的年代吗
A major rollback on civil rights?

195
00:09:55,060 --> 00:09:56,680
不是啦 是办午宴
No, the luncheon.

196
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,380
让她再开心最后一次吧
She deserves one last hurrah

197
00:09:58,380 --> 00:10:00,060
之后再告诉她失去一切的真相
before I tell her she's lost everything.

198
00:10:00,460 --> 00:10:01,560
真希望当年我的人生掉落谷底前
I wish someone had done that for me

199
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:03,180
也有人为我这么做
before my life came crashing down.

200
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:05,040
好吧 我会帮你
Okay, I'll help you.

201
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:07,240
应该是玛丽亚会帮你 前提是她能请到保姆看小孩
I mean, Maria will, if she can find a babysitter.

202
00:10:18,260 --> 00:10:20,880
这身爆乳女仆装 我只为你一人穿
You are the only person I'll wear this for.

203
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:23,520
有没有那300块预付款都愿意
You know, without the $300 up front.

204
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:27,640
幸好苏菲有女仆装
Thank God Sophie had that maid outfit.

205
00:10:27,940 --> 00:10:29,260
我觉得这身衣服能行
I think this is gonna work.

206
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:34,720
只要你不转身便万事大吉
As long as you don't turn around.

207
00:10:36,540 --> 00:10:38,200
卡洛琳 是你吗
Caroline, is that you?

208
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,600
她要出来了 赶快
Oh, she's coming. Quick.

209
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:41,760
快去屏风后面 把套装套上
Behind the screen. Put the suit on over that.

210
00:10:42,260 --> 00:10:45,280
你要我在一个屏风后面换上香奈儿套装吗
You want me to change into a Chanel suit behind this screen?

211
00:10:45,420 --> 00:10:47,420
空间大着呢 我都干过无数次了
Oh, there's room. I've done it numerous times.

212
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:51,280
我们其余的员工来了吗
Oh, did the rest of our staff arrive yet?

213
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:53,300
来了 如果他们也算员工的话
Yes, if you can call them that.

214
00:10:53,300 --> 00:10:55,139
话说你们从哪儿找来的这些奇人
Where did you find them anyway?

215
00:10:55,139 --> 00:10:57,660
就附近啊
Um, around.

216
00:10:58,620 --> 00:11:01,420
把我推到餐厅啊
Just push me into the room!

217
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:07,080
我已经尽力了
I'm doing the best I can!

218
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:09,700
这裤子大了整整五个号
These pants are five sizes too big!

219
00:11:11,060 --> 00:11:14,160
伯纳德 下次不要雇童工了
Bernard, next time, don't hire a child butler.

220
00:11:14,660 --> 00:11:18,180
还有你 难道中国没有轮椅吗
And you, don't they have wheelchairs in China?

221
00:11:18,740 --> 00:11:20,620
我是泡菜国人好吗
I'm from Korea!

222
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:23,100
我觉得不像
I don't think so.

223
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:28,600
告诉卡洛琳她欠我一份大人情
Tell Caroline she owes me.

224
00:11:28,740 --> 00:11:30,560
鬼知道穿奥列格的男仆装
Who knows what STD I'm catching

225
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:32,240
会害我染上什么性病
from Oleg's butler costume?

226
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:35,340
再说了 他怎么会有这种衣服
And why does he even have this?

227
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:38,000
这是他们玩《淫家屯》的戏服
It's from when they play "Going Downtown Abbey."

228
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:43,120
玛丽亚 我头发需要打理
Maria, I need help with my hair.

229
00:11:43,380 --> 00:11:44,940
你来发挥吧
See what you can do.

230
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:48,520
不行 我不太擅长那方面
Um, no, I'm not really good at that.

231
00:11:49,380 --> 00:11:51,480
玛丽亚 快去 帮她弄
Maria, just do it. Go.

232
00:11:54,420 --> 00:11:55,100
好吧
Okay.

233
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:58,900
满足你一次 下不为例
You get one of those, and that was it.

234
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:05,440
这才是我的孙女 你看起来真美
Oh, there's my girl. You look wonderful.

235
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:08,780
我都忘了香奈儿的衣服质感有多好
I forgot how good Chanel feels against my skin.

236
00:12:09,140 --> 00:12:10,400
感觉就像回到家
It's like coming home,

237
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:12,417
回到一个用丝绸和希望搭建的房子
but the house is made of silk and hope.

238
00:12:12,417 --> 00:12:15,678
这样会太《星球大战》莱娅公主风吗
How's this? A little too Princess Leia?

239
00:12:18,180 --> 00:12:21,860
上面 我喜欢在上面
On top! I like it up on top.

240
00:12:30,660 --> 00:12:32,460
奶奶 不要这么少儿不宜好吗
Whoa, Grammy. Keep it PG.

241
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:40,760
我在哪里
Where am I?

242
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:45,170
格特鲁德·古尔斯比来了
Oh, it's Gertrude Goolsby.

243
00:12:45,660 --> 00:12:47,840
您第一位也是唯一一位来的宾客
Your first and only guest has arrived.

244
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,140
阿斯特丽德
Astrid!

245
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,202
我必须得...
Oh, have to--oh.

246
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:55,740
悄然走近你
Sneaks up on you.

247
00:12:57,880 --> 00:12:59,560
祝你一切顺利
Good luck with all this.

248
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:03,220
我会在厨房 学习墨西哥连锁餐厅的菜单
I'll be in the kitchen, studying the Chipotle menu.

249
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:05,120
为我下一份工作做准备
For my next job.

250
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:09,500
你看起来真美 阿斯特丽德
Don't you look smashing, Astrid.

251
00:13:10,020 --> 00:13:12,080
我猜的 我已经看不见了
I'm assuming. I can't see anymore.

252
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:16,080
我猜你和奶奶
Well, I bet you and Grammy have

253
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:18,240
一定有很多趣事要叙叙旧
a lot of fun stuff to catch up on.

254
00:13:18,660 --> 00:13:20,180
戈登还好吗
How is Gordon?

255
00:13:20,180 --> 00:13:22,140
他得了脸癌
He has face cancer.

256
00:13:24,460 --> 00:13:26,660
要不聊聊天气也行啊
Or the weather is also a subject.

257
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,540
我们希望马上上第一道菜
We'd like the first course, pronto.

258
00:13:30,960 --> 00:13:32,580
玛丽亚 别一副死人样
Maria! Look alive.

259
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:34,760
彼此彼此
You're one to talk.

260
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:41,720
满足她一次 下不为例
And she gets one of those and that was it.

261
00:13:44,460 --> 00:13:46,100
亲爱的 我能问你个问题吗
Dear, may I ask you a question?

262
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:48,680
我在哪里
Where am I?

263
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:54,000
还有我们的酒侍呢
Oh, and where is our sommelier?

264
00:13:54,660 --> 00:13:57,100
随时为您效劳
At your service.

265
00:13:59,180 --> 00:14:00,460
来点酒吗
Some wine?

266
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:08,260
是我失误 这瓶没了
My bad. This one's empty.

267
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:10,200
我等无聊了
I got bored.

268
00:14:13,660 --> 00:14:15,320
您呢 夫人
And what about you, ma'am?

269
00:14:16,100 --> 00:14:17,240
干白 干红
White, red,

270
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:19,640
还是你喜欢"干"巧克力棕
or maybe you prefer a chocolate brown?

271
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,820
原来我来到了新奥尔良
I must be in New Orleans.

272
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:27,260
找到了
Here we go.

273
00:14:28,100 --> 00:14:30,600
这瓶是产自波尔多酒区
It's from the Bordeaux region.

274
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:33,300
更像是来自好市多超市区
More like the Costco region.

275
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,200
玛丽亚
Maria!

276
00:14:37,420 --> 00:14:38,860
叫我啊
That's me.

277
00:14:40,400 --> 00:14:44,201
为什么这些叉子都摆放错了
Why are these forks not laid out correctly?

278
00:14:44,201 --> 00:14:46,714
玛丽亚 赶紧摆叉子
Maria, forks, now.

279
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:49,060
很高兴你喜欢我这身衣服
Glad you like that outfit,

280
00:14:49,060 --> 00:14:51,176
因为它将会是你的寿服
'cause you're gonna be buried in it.

281
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:56,020
我把这瓶红酒拿到厨房醒醒酒
I think I'm gonna let this one breathe in the kitchen.

282
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:01,360
卡洛琳 我想见见主厨
Caroline, I'd like to meet the chef.

283
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:03,540
当然可以 主厨
Oh, of course. Chef!

284
00:15:04,820 --> 00:15:05,420
各位好
Booyah!

285
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:08,220
我是奥列格主厨
I'm Chef Oleg.

286
00:15:09,040 --> 00:15:11,220
曾有幸被地狱厨神锁头暴打的厨师
Gordon Ramsay once put me in a headlock.

287
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:16,720
请享用我第一道菜的第一道菜
Please enjoy the first course of my first course:

288
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:19,480
美味的意式饺子
a tasty tortellini.

289
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:25,560
卡洛琳 这个酱汁太好吃了
Caroline, this sauce is delicious!

290
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,220
很高兴你能喜欢
Oh, I'm so glad you like it.

291
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:30,460
这顿午宴就是要让你觉得
This is the kind of luncheon that makes you feel

292
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:33,080
你能承受随之而来的任何事物
like you can handle anything that comes along.

293
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:36,760
可惜没有更多宾客能一起享用
Pity there aren't more guests to enjoy it.

294
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:39,240
亲
Darling!

295
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:51,280
恕我姗姗来迟 希望还能赶上午宴
Well, I hope I'm not late for the luncheon!

296
00:15:59,050 --> 00:16:01,380
这个法式布丁真是天赐之物
This creme brule is just divine!

297
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:05,640
千万别介意我随意点啊
Don't mind if I don't mind.

298
00:16:09,460 --> 00:16:13,720
不好意思 我得嘘嘘
Uh, excuse me. I have to tinkle.

299
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:15,080
厕所[约翰]在哪里
Where's your john?

300
00:16:16,040 --> 00:16:17,149
人家忘了嘛
Oh, I forgot!

301
00:16:17,149 --> 00:16:19,400
好啦
Yes, um...

302
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:21,940
请见谅
Pardon me, yes.

303
00:16:22,580 --> 00:16:25,140
麻烦告诉我您家的...
Could you direct me to your...

304
00:16:26,420 --> 00:16:26,540
茅厕[约翰森]怎么走吗
Jonathan?

305
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:36,540
阿斯特丽德 亲爱的
Astrid, darling,

306
00:16:36,660 --> 00:16:40,100
我之前不太确定你的午宴会是怎么样
I wasn't sure what to expect from one of your lunches,

307
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:41,740
毕竟自从那件丑闻后
you know, since the scandal,

308
00:16:42,540 --> 00:16:44,000
你失去所有的...
since you lost all of your--

309
00:16:46,625 --> 00:16:47,480
我是说
I mean, uh...

310
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:50,420
午宴结束啦 格特鲁德要走啦
Lunch is over. Gertrude is leaving.

311
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:52,940
丑闻 什么丑闻
Scandal? What scandal?

312
00:16:52,940 --> 00:16:54,520
你懂的
Oh, you know.

313
00:16:54,580 --> 00:16:57,220
你最深的恐惧 身无...
The horror of you not having any more--

314
00:16:57,340 --> 00:16:59,059
救命 铃儿摇两下
Mayday! Double dingle!

315
00:16:59,059 --> 00:17:00,738
玛丽亚 想想办法
Maria, do something.

316
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:04,420
所以你的意思是她不想谈论
So you mean she doesn't want to talk about the fact

317
00:17:04,420 --> 00:17:06,260
她失去所有...
that she's lost all her mon--

318
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:11,040
摔碎的是水晶杯啊
Oh, it's crystal that broke.

319
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:13,100
我还以为是阿斯特丽德的老骨头呢
I thought it was one of Astrid's bones.

320
00:17:15,300 --> 00:17:17,640
我会赔的啦 虽然我赔不起
I'll replace it. I mean, I can't,

321
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:19,220
但貌似当下这么说才对
but it's the right thing to say right now.

322
00:17:20,040 --> 00:17:23,400
玛丽亚 那是我好的水晶杯
Maria, that's my good crystal.

323
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:26,460
它无可替代 不像你
And it's not replaceable, unlike you.

324
00:17:27,020 --> 00:17:29,140
-给我出去 -好
- Now go! - Fine.

325
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:32,500
我马上走 去玛丽亚生活的地方
I'll go. To wherever Maria lives.

326
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:37,100
但我想告诉你 你的孙女
But just know your granddaughter

327
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:39,400
为了午宴完美 真的费尽心思
worked really hard to make this lunch all nice.

328
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:41,440
不 你不用走
No, you don't have to go.

329
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:42,800
那我能走吗
Oh, can I go?

330
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:48,020
或许我也该走
Maybe I should go too.

331
00:17:48,180 --> 00:17:49,740
有人信我有安排吗
Would anyone buy that I had plans?

332
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:52,240
都不许走
No one is going.

333
00:17:52,540 --> 00:17:54,680
我去把摔碎的水晶杯捡起来
I'm just gonna pick up the broken crystal

334
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:57,480
然后继续这场完美的午宴
and we'll just continue to have the best luncheon ever.

335
00:17:58,580 --> 00:18:00,520
卡洛琳 让佣人去捡
Caroline! Let the help do that.

336
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:02,800
不许蹲在地上
Get up off of that floor!

337
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:04,460
你又不是他们中的一员
You are not one of them.

338
00:18:07,260 --> 00:18:10,380
老实说 我是
Actually, yes, I am.

339
00:18:11,740 --> 00:18:13,140
奶奶 或许你才从昏迷中醒来
Grammy, you may have been in a coma,

340
00:18:13,220 --> 00:18:15,480
但我觉得刚大梦方醒的人是我
but I feel like it's me that just woke up.

341
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:17,320
在过去五年中
For the past five years,

342
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:20,100
我真的很想念这一切
I have been really missing all of this,

343
00:18:20,860 --> 00:18:23,560
但让人生有意义的不是一个上好的水晶杯
but it's not good crystal that makes a life.

344
00:18:23,880 --> 00:18:25,120
而是好人
It's good people.

345
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:27,100
像他们这样的人
People like them.

346
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:29,860
他们不是"佣人"
And they are not "the help,"

347
00:18:31,560 --> 00:18:33,520
但他们却心甘情愿为我所"用"
but they did come here to help me.

348
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:35,780
或许我和你有血缘关系
'Cause you and I might be related,

349
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:37,820
但现在这些人才是我的家人
but these people are my family now.

350
00:18:38,820 --> 00:18:41,780
还有 我该告诉你
And also, I should tell you,

351
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:44,100
我不在华尔街工作
I don't work on Wall Street.

352
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:48,460
我在布鲁克林的一家餐厅工作
I work in Brooklyn, in a diner.

353
00:18:49,500 --> 00:18:51,640
瞧 我是一名服务员
See? I'm a waitress.

354
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,480
这点有待商议
That's debatable.

355
00:18:57,800 --> 00:19:00,340
我不明白
I don't understand.

356
00:19:01,300 --> 00:19:02,820
你可是钱宁家族的人
You're a Channing.

357
00:19:03,220 --> 00:19:05,360
你怎么能去当服务员呢
How could you be a waitress?

358
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:08,480
因为这位千金 千金散尽
Because she lost all her money

359
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:11,550
而你也身无分文了
when you lost all your money.

360
00:19:14,540 --> 00:19:16,320
卡洛琳 她在说什么
Caroline, what is she saying?

361
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:17,700
没什么 别听她的
Nothing, she's saying nothing.

362
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:18,860
我是说
I'm saying,

363
00:19:18,860 --> 00:19:20,800
你是穷鬼
you're poor.

364
00:19:29,420 --> 00:19:31,620
我就离开两分钟
Oh, I leave for two minutes

365
00:19:31,620 --> 00:19:33,920
这派对就立马玩完啦
and the party really goes downhill!

366
00:19:43,280 --> 00:19:45,460
你奶奶的事很遗憾 亲爱的
I'm sorry again about your grandma, darlin'.

367
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:47,080
多谢关心 厄尔
Thanks, Earl.

368
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:49,540
她也算死得其所了
Well, she did die doing what she loved:

369
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:51,440
当着富人 吼着佣人
being rich and yelling at the help.

370
00:19:55,980 --> 00:19:58,760
我会超级想念她
I'm gonna miss her so much!

371
00:20:01,260 --> 00:20:03,100
苏菲 你认识她不过三道菜的时间
Sophie, you knew her for three courses.

372
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:07,780
我知道 姐的波兰日间艾美奖可不是白得的
I know; I didn't win that Polish daytime Emmy for nothing!

373
00:20:10,780 --> 00:20:13,500
卡洛琳 你为她举办午宴
You know, Caroline, you did the right thing

374
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:14,480
这事做得对
throwing that luncheon.

375
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:15,680
我的胯部拉伤了
And I pulled a glute

376
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:18,000
只因帮你那可爱的种族歧视奶奶推轮椅
pushing your lovely racist grandmother around.

377
00:20:19,420 --> 00:20:22,840
我真的很感激你们帮我办这个午宴
I really appreciate you guys helping me with the luncheon.

378
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,640
对了 奥列格 我尝了尝食物
And, Oleg, I tried the food,

379
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:25,940
一点儿也不恶心
and it wasn't gross.

380
00:20:26,500 --> 00:20:27,640
你听到了吗 阿憨
You hear that, Han?

381
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:29,900
一点儿也不 恶心
Wasn't. Gross.

382
00:20:31,820 --> 00:20:33,900
干了几个小时服务员后
After being a servant for a few hours,

383
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:36,320
我理解你们需要忍受的事情太多了
I get how much you all have to put up with.

384
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:38,640
所以我要给你们都加薪
So, I'm giving you all a raise!

385
00:20:39,340 --> 00:20:41,360
太感谢了 阿憨
Thank you so much, Han!

386
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:42,680
人人都有份吗
Everyone?

387
00:20:43,220 --> 00:20:45,040
他们又不需要药钱生孩子
They don't need drug money for a baby.

388
00:20:46,300 --> 00:20:49,160
但你眼前这位27岁女性 也需要买"药"钱啊
No, but we need drug money for a 27-year-old woman.
